## 3. `.well-known/` Folder (2 Domain Association Files)

These files support Android Trusted Web Activities (TWA) and iOS Universal Links, and are excluded from Service Worker navigation interception in `workbox-config.js`.

### `.well-known/assetlinks.json`
```json
[
  {
    "relation": [
      "delegate_permission/common.handle_all_urls"
    ],
    "target": {
      "namespace": "android_app",
      "package_name": "io.github.githubbest729.teklastudio",
      "sha256_cert_fingerprints": [
        "00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00:00"
      ]
    }
  }
]
